      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → fal → fal Settings**.\n2. Describe your host in **Host**, and what they do in **Scene**.\n3. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/fal`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
