            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**File: Add** gives Wan 3.0 the host as `start_image_url`, the field for the first frame. Wan starts on the host and makes a five-second 480p video with sound. `arguments` sets `resolution` and `duration`, because Wan's own default is 1080p. Raise `duration` for up to 30 seconds.\n\nIf you cancel while the request still waits in fal's queue, fal drops it and bills nothing. A request fal has already started may still finish and be billed. Collect it with **video-05-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
